That file's header states, as required by Apache-2.0 section 4(b), exactly what
was changed: Aider runtime coupling removed, unreachable dead code dropped, the
apply function made pure (it no longer touches the filesystem), and a whole-file
block parser ported from WholeFileCoder.get_edits.

